[en.FOCUS_C04_MUFFIN_INVESTIGATE]
Investigate Muffin Exports

[en.FOCUS_C04_MUFFIN_INVESTIGATE_desc]
Cloudsdale has been frequently complaining about the quality issues of Muffin Exports, and even explosions have occurred, but the local catering industry of Stratusburg has never reported any related incidents.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_MUFFIN_INVESTIGATE]
调查马芬出口

[zh.FOCUS_C04_MUFFIN_INVESTIGATE_desc]
云中城正在频繁投诉马芬出口的质量问题，甚至出现爆炸的情况，但层云堡本土的餐饮行业却从未报告过相关的事件。

